♪ ♪

02:50.275 --> 02:55.310
SpongeBob, can you open this
breakfast envelope for me?
海绵宝宝，你能打开这个吗
给我的早餐信封？

02:55.379 --> 02:58.137
- You got a breakfast
envelope too?
- 你吃早餐了
信封也有吗？

02:58.206 --> 02:59.896
How mysterious.
多么神秘啊。

02:59.965 --> 03:01.655
Let's open them together.
让我们一起打开它们吧。

03:01.724 --> 03:03.241
- Oh, yeah.
- 哦，是的。

03:11.310 --> 03:14.137
- This letter's just snot
gonna open.
- 这封信只是鼻涕
要打开了

03:14.206 --> 03:16.034
[laughs]
[笑]

03:16.965 --> 03:19.344
Maybe it just needs
a little extra elbow grease.
也许只是需要
一点额外的肘部油脂。

03:23.000 --> 03:24.206
- Whoa!
- See?
- 哇！
- 看？

03:24.275 --> 03:25.827
What did I tell... ow.
我说什么了……哎哟。

03:25.896 --> 03:28.448
My old Kamp Koral neckerchief?
我的旧 Kamp Koral 围巾？

03:28.517 --> 03:29.862
Neat.
整洁的。

03:33.620 --> 03:34.655
- Oh.
- 哦。

03:34.724 --> 03:37.862
My old Kamp Koral underwear.
我的旧 Kamp Koral 内衣。

03:37.931 --> 03:40.586
I haven't worn these in years.
我已经很多年没穿过这些了。

03:40.655 --> 03:42.758
- Say, you think
anyone else got sent
- 说吧，你认为
其他人已发送

03:42.827 --> 03:45.172
fun Kamp Koral memories?
有趣的坎普·科拉尔回忆吗？

03:45.241 --> 03:47.310
Let's ask our
old bunkmate, Sandy.
来问问我们的
老室友桑迪。

03:47.379 --> 03:48.448
- Ooh.
- 哦。

03:48.517 --> 03:50.551
I think these memories
are cutting off
我想这些回忆
正在切断

03:50.620 --> 03:54.241
the circulation to my brain.
我的大脑的循环。

03:54.310 --> 03:55.758
[confetti toots]
[五彩纸屑嘟嘟]

03:58.206 --> 03:59.068
- Envelope?
- 信封？

03:59.137 --> 04:00.931
Oh, yeah, I got one of those.
哦，是的，我有其中之一。

04:01.000 --> 04:03.379
Opened it up and got hit
right in the kisser
打开却被击中
就在接吻者身上

04:03.448 --> 04:05.000
by my old braces.
我的旧牙套。

04:07.310 --> 04:08.344
- Cool.
- 凉爽的。

04:08.413 --> 04:10.172
Everyone got a prize.
每个人都获得了奖品。

04:10.241 --> 04:12.448
Okay, mystery solved.
Goodbye.
好吧，谜团解开了。
再见。

04:12.517 --> 04:15.379
- Wait, didn't you read
the letter in the envelope?
- 等等，你没读过吗
信封里的信？

04:15.448 --> 04:18.206
- The letter?
- 那封信？

04:18.275 --> 04:21.034
- "Do you miss the carefree
days of your youth?
——“你怀念无忧无虑的日子吗？
你的青春岁月？

04:21.103 --> 04:24.068
"Well, pine away no more,
because you're invited
“好了，别再憔悴了，
因为你被邀请了

04:24.137 --> 04:27.000
"to a killer reunion
at Kamp Koral.
“杀手重聚
在坎普科拉尔。

04:27.068 --> 04:30.103
"Come relive your
childhood and party down.
“来重温你的
童年和聚会下来。

04:30.172 --> 04:33.206
You'll just die
from all the fun."
你就会死掉
远离所有的乐趣。”

04:33.275 --> 04:35.586
Signed, "X."
署名“X”。

04:35.655 --> 04:37.379
Do you know what this means?
你知道这意味着什么吗？

04:37.448 --> 04:38.793
- Yup.
- 是的。

04:38.862 --> 04:43.000
"This" refers to a specific
person or object.
“这个”指的是具体的
人或物体。

04:43.965 --> 04:45.517
- Yeah, that is right.
- 是的，没错。

04:45.586 --> 04:49.517
But it also means we're
going back to Kamp Koral!
但这也意味着我们
回到坎普科拉尔！

04:49.586 --> 04:51.379
- Yeehaw! High five.
- 耶哈！高五。

04:51.448 --> 04:52.482
- High five.
- 高五。

04:53.793 --> 04:55.758
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:55.827 --> 04:57.241
- Get swole!
- 膨胀起来！

04:57.310 --> 04:58.379
Huh?
啊？

05:00.241 --> 05:01.586
[school bell rings]
- Oh.
[放学铃声响起]
- 哦。

05:01.655 --> 05:03.379
- It's just as good as...
- Ah!
- 这就像...一样好
- 啊！

05:03.448 --> 05:04.896
[laughing]
[笑]

05:05.827 --> 05:07.172
[confetti toots]
- [grunts]
[五彩纸屑嘟嘟]
- [咕哝]

05:07.241 --> 05:08.241
- Oh!
- 哦！

05:09.724 --> 05:10.793
- Meep.
[confetti tooting]
- 米普。
[五彩纸屑鸣响]

05:10.862 --> 05:11.862
- Meep.
- 米普。

05:11.896 --> 05:13.000
- Moop.
- 穆普。

05:14.206 --> 05:15.206
Mop.
拖把。

05:17.689 --> 05:19.275
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

05:19.344 --> 05:20.517
[confetti toots]
[五彩纸屑嘟嘟]

05:20.586 --> 05:21.620
Huh?
啊？

05:21.689 --> 05:23.793
[mumbling]
[咕哝]

05:23.862 --> 05:25.724
I ain't going
to some dumb reunion
我不去
一些愚蠢的重聚

05:25.793 --> 05:27.310
at the old summer camp.
在老夏令营。

05:27.379 --> 05:30.068
I barely shut that place
down in time to avoid
我几乎没有关闭那个地方
及时下降以避免

05:30.137 --> 05:32.241
all those health code
violations.
所有这些健康码
违规行为。

05:34.206 --> 05:35.275
Huh?
啊？

05:35.344 --> 05:38.517
I'd know this nickel anywhere.
我在任何地方都会认识这枚五分钱。

05:38.586 --> 05:40.517
"P.S., Look familiar?
“P.S.，你看起来很眼熟吗？

05:40.586 --> 05:44.000
Come and get the rest
if you dare."
过来拿剩下的
如果你敢的话。”

05:44.068 --> 05:46.172
[gasps]
Sweet Neptune!
[喘气]
甜蜜的海王星！

05:46.241 --> 05:48.379
A map to me lost camp nickels.
一张地图给我丢了营地镍币。

05:48.448 --> 05:51.689
The ones I hid so well,
even I forgot where I hid 'em.
那些我隐藏得很好的人，
连我都忘了我把它们藏在哪里了。

05:51.758 --> 05:53.827
Me and me money.
我和我的钱。

05:55.000 --> 05:57.172
Now that's a reunion
worth attending.
现在这就是重逢
值得参加。

05:57.241 --> 05:59.034
[laughs]
[笑]

06:00.517 --> 06:04.620
- Oh, boy, I can't wait
to go back to Kamp Koral.
- 哦，孩子，我等不及了
回到坎普科拉尔。

06:04.689 --> 06:06.862
- Yeah. But how are
we gonna get there?
- 是的。但怎么样
我们能到达那里吗？

06:06.931 --> 06:08.551
My unicycle is in the shop.
我的独轮车在店里。

06:08.620 --> 06:09.793
- Well...
- I know.
- 嗯...
- 我知道。

06:09.862 --> 06:11.448
We could prance.
我们可以腾跃。

06:11.517 --> 06:15.310
- Oh, boy, I haven't
pranced in ages.
-哦，孩子，我还没有
多年来一直欢腾。

06:15.379 --> 06:17.689
Both: ♪ La la la la la la ♪
两人：♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

06:17.758 --> 06:19.103
all: ♪ La la la la la la ♪
全体：♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

06:20.137 --> 06:22.689
- Just get on the bus.
- 上公共汽车就可以了。

06:22.758 --> 06:24.068
- Oh, yeah, the bus.
- 哦，是的，公共汽车。

06:24.137 --> 06:25.620
- Yeah, I do suppose
that makes sense.
- 是的，我确实认为
这是有道理的。

06:27.758 --> 06:30.655
