06:32.172 --> 06:34.758
- [pants] Wait for me, dudes.
- [裤子]等我，伙计们。

06:35.551 --> 06:38.034
- And that's why Barnacle Boy,
with both hands...
- 这就是为什么藤壶男孩，
用双手...

06:38.103 --> 06:39.586
