♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:53.482 --> 06:55.586
- [laughing]
- [笑]

06:55.655 --> 06:56.655
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

06:57.931 --> 06:59.965
[laughter]
[笑声]

07:01.275 --> 07:03.862
- What are you looking at, boyo?
- 你在看什么，男孩？

07:03.931 --> 07:06.137
- [sighs]
You haven't changed a bit
- [叹气]
你一点也没变

07:06.206 --> 07:08.241
since camp, Mr. Krabs.
自从营地以来，蟹老板。

07:08.310 --> 07:10.103
Greetings, fellow campers.
各位营员们，大家好。

07:10.172 --> 07:12.034
I'd like to personally thank
我想亲自感谢

07:12.103 --> 07:15.379
whoever invited us
to the big reunion.
无论谁邀请我们
到大团聚。

07:15.448 --> 07:17.758
So who was it?
那是谁呢？

07:17.827 --> 07:19.482
- Not me.
- Not me.
- 不是我。
- 不是我。

07:19.551 --> 07:21.103
- Not me.
- 不是我。

07:21.172 --> 07:23.758
- Oh, well, we're sure
to when we get there.
- 哦，好吧，我们确定
到我们到达那里的时候。

07:23.827 --> 07:26.724
Next stop, Camp Money!
[cash register dings]
下一站，钱营！
[收银机叮叮声]

07:28.034 --> 07:29.620
- Eugene.
- 尤金.

07:29.689 --> 07:32.413
- I mean Kamp Koral.
- 我的意思是坎普·科拉尔。

07:32.482 --> 07:34.448
[cheering]
[欢呼]

07:34.517 --> 07:35.758
- Yeah!
- 是的！

07:35.827 --> 07:37.206
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

07:37.275 --> 07:40.172
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

07:40.241 --> 07:45.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:45.275 --> 07:47.862
- Ah, good old Kamp Koral.
- 啊，好老的坎普·科拉尔。

07:47.931 --> 07:50.586
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

07:50.655 --> 07:51.689
