♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:51.758 --> 07:55.241
It seems different somehow.
似乎有些不同。

07:55.310 --> 07:59.103
- Looks like they
changed the name to Kaka.
- 看起来他们
改名为卡卡。

07:59.172 --> 08:01.344
- Well, I must say,
- 嗯，我必须说，

08:01.413 --> 08:04.448
the place has really
gone to pot.
这个地方确实有
去锅了。

08:04.517 --> 08:06.206
- Well, I think
someone is pulling
- 嗯，我想
有人在拉

08:06.275 --> 08:08.448
a fast one with this reunion.
这次重聚是一个快速的过程。

08:08.517 --> 08:11.034
- Don't listen to her,
little nickel.
- 别听她的
小镍。

08:11.103 --> 08:13.206
We'll find your friends soon.
我们很快就会找到你的朋友。

08:13.275 --> 08:18.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:18.586 --> 08:22.241
- This place is, like,
way smaller than I remember.
- 这个地方就像，
比我记忆中的小得多。

08:22.310 --> 08:23.827
- It's not smaller.
- 它并不小。

08:23.896 --> 08:25.758
You're just bigger.
你只是更大了。

08:25.827 --> 08:28.379
But it is a lot crummier.
但它要糟糕得多。

08:28.448 --> 08:29.620
- [laughs]
- [笑]

08:29.689 --> 08:32.413
