joke has gone far enough.
- 好吧，我想这个
玩笑已经开得够远了。

08:32.482 --> 08:34.689
Everyone, back on the bus.
各位，回到巴士上。

08:34.758 --> 08:37.517
We are not staying here.
我们不住在这里。

08:37.586 --> 08:38.724
[tires hissing]
[轮胎嘶嘶声]

08:38.793 --> 08:41.068
[clanging]
[叮叮当当]

08:42.344 --> 08:44.724
Not to worry, I'll get the tools
不用担心，我会去拿工具的

08:44.793 --> 08:47.034
and we'll put
the wheels back on.
我们将把
轮子重新启动。

08:47.103 --> 08:49.137
[rustling]
[沙沙声]

08:50.862 --> 08:52.724
Maybe we could just...
也许我们可以...

08:55.482 --> 08:57.827
- Well, looks like we're walking
- 嗯，看起来我们正在走路

08:57.896 --> 08:59.793
back across the bridge.
过桥回来。

08:59.862 --> 09:02.241
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:02.310 --> 09:03.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:03.482 --> 09:04.689
- Oh, no.
- 哦，不。

09:04.758 --> 09:06.862
We'll have to use
the old tunnel.
我们必须使用
旧隧道。

09:06.931 --> 09:12.620
