♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:12.689 --> 09:13.793
That's okay.
没关系。

09:13.862 --> 09:15.827
To the hot air balloon field.
前往热气球场。

09:18.758 --> 09:20.172
- We're trapped!
- 我们被困住了！

09:20.241 --> 09:22.655
- Every way to get is gone.
- 所有获得的方法都消失了。

09:22.724 --> 09:25.620
- Maybe for the
likes of you rabble.
- 也许是为了
喜欢你们这些乌合之众。

09:25.689 --> 09:29.931
Regigilled, commence
Operation Wealth Extraction.
重新调整，开始
财富提取行动。

09:30.000 --> 09:31.758
- What in tarnation?
- 塔尼翁什么？

09:31.827 --> 09:33.000
- What is that?
- 那是什么？

09:33.068 --> 09:34.413
- What is it?
- 这是什么？

09:34.482 --> 09:35.310
- Huh?
- 啊？

09:35.379 --> 09:36.724
- Wait!
- Wait!
- 等待！
- 等待！

09:36.793 --> 09:38.620
[shouting]
[喊叫]

09:38.689 --> 09:39.931
- Hurry, Regigilled.
- 快点，雷吉利德。

09:40.000 --> 09:42.275
[clamoring]
[叫喊]

09:45.793 --> 09:49.586
Look what you've done to
my third favorite helicopter.
看看你做了什么
我第三喜欢的直升机。

09:49.655 --> 09:51.758
I am offended.
我很生气。

09:51.827 --> 09:55.137
- Hey, at least no one
got hurt, right?
- 嘿，至少没有人
受伤了，对吧？

09:57.379 --> 09:59.758
- Oh, finally alone.
- 哦，终于一个人了。

09:59.827 --> 10:01.931
Now to find me booty.
现在来给我找战利品。

10:02.000 --> 10:03.000
Let's see.
让我们来看看。

10:03.068 --> 10:05.034
100 paces south.
向南100步。

10:05.103 --> 10:06.103
Okay.
好的。

10:06.172 --> 10:08.137
One, two, three.
一二三。

10:08.206 --> 10:09.827
[banging]
[砰砰]

10:12.413 --> 10:14.655
Hey, out of my way, cabin.
嘿，别挡我的路，小屋。

10:14.724 --> 10:16.724
[cabin whimpering]
[机舱呜咽声]

10:16.793 --> 10:18.103
Stupid cabin.
愚蠢的小屋。

10:19.000 --> 10:20.448
Four, five.
四、五。

10:23.448 --> 10:26.448
- What should we do now,
Mr. Krabs?
- 我们现在应该做什么，
蟹老板？

10:26.517 --> 10:27.827
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

10:27.896 --> 10:30.448
- Has anyone seen Eugene?
- 有人见过尤金吗？

10:30.517 --> 10:34.000
- I think I saw him walk off
with something under his arm.
- 我想我看见他走开了
腋下夹着什么东西。

10:34.068 --> 10:37.206
- If my dad had a newspaper
under his arm when he left,
- 如果我爸爸有一份报纸
离开时夹在腋下，

10:37.275 --> 10:40.137
we won't see him
for a couple of hours.
我们不会见到他
几个小时。

10:40.206 --> 10:43.827
- 98, 99, 100.
- 98、99、100。
- 98、99、100。
- 98、99、100。

10:43.896 --> 10:46.206
Ooh, X marks the spot.
哦，X 标记了位置。

10:47.827 --> 10:49.724
[laughing]
[笑]

10:51.068 --> 10:52.586
Found it!
找到了！

10:52.655 --> 10:54.551
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:54.620 --> 10:58.620
Ooh, now to get
what's coming to me.
哦，现在要得到
我会发生什么。

10:58.689 --> 11:00.000
Huh?
啊？

11:00.068 --> 11:03.172
[screaming]
[尖叫]

11:03.241 --> 11:06.344
- Hey, that sounds
like Mr. Krabs...
- 嘿，听起来
就像蟹老板一样...

11:06.413 --> 11:08.172
having a blast.
玩得很开心。

11:08.241 --> 11:09.965
Good ol' Camp Master Krabs.
好蟹蟹营长。

11:10.034 --> 11:11.827
He knows how to have fun.
他知道如何享受乐趣。

11:11.896 --> 11:13.793
Whoo-hoo!
[cheering]
呼呼！
[欢呼]

11:13.862 --> 11:14.931
[engine revving]
[发动机转速]

11:15.000 --> 11:16.344
- What's that?
- 那是什么？

11:16.413 --> 11:18.482
- Maybe it's another bus
to take us home.
- 也许是另一辆巴士
带我们回家。

11:18.551 --> 11:21.655
[heavy metal music]
[重金属音乐]

11:21.724 --> 11:24.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:24.275 --> 11:26.206
Nurse Helga!
赫尔加护士！

11:26.275 --> 11:27.965
- It is me.
- 是我。

11:28.034 --> 11:30.379
I am here for the reunion.
我是来参加团聚的。

11:31.310 --> 11:32.655
- What'd I miss?
- 我错过了什么？

11:32.724 --> 11:33.862
- Oh.
- 哦。

11:33.931 --> 11:36.689
And it looks like I
got here just in time.
而且看起来我
来得正是时候。

11:36.758 --> 11:38.034
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

11:38.103 --> 11:40.689
- Come back, bubby
with the boo boo.
- 回来吧，巴比
与嘘声。

11:40.758 --> 11:44.620
- Looks like Kamp Koral is
reopened for business.
- 看起来坎普·科拉尔是
重新营业。

11:44.689 --> 11:47.586
[cheering]
[欢呼]

11:49.172 --> 11:51.586
[indistinct chattering]
[模糊不清的喋喋不休]

11:51.655 --> 11:54.206
- Well, gang, if we're
gonna be stuck here,
- 好吧，伙计们，如果我们
会被困在这里

11:54.275 --> 11:57.379
we might as well enjoy
being back in camp.
我们不妨享受
回到营地。

11:57.448 --> 11:59.965
♪ Jump up and cheer
for old Kamp Koral ♪
♪ 跳起来欢呼
献给老坎普·科拉尔 ♪

12:00.034 --> 12:03.344
♪ where the food is bad
and tastes abnormal ♪
♪ 食物不好的地方
而且味道异常♪

12:03.413 --> 12:04.700
♪ The bunks are
filled with bugs ♪
♪ 铺位是
充满虫子♪

12:04.724 --> 12:06.379
♪ And the woods are
paranormal ♪
♪ 树林里
超自然现象♪

12:06.448 --> 12:10.310
♪ But we love it here in camp,
so there will be no quarrel ♪
♪ 但我们喜欢这里的营地，
这样就不会吵架了♪

12:12.068 --> 12:14.379
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

12:16.344 --> 12:19.551
- Is this really our old cabin?
- 这真的是我们的旧小屋吗？

12:20.793 --> 12:22.896
Regigilled, door.
重装，门。

12:25.758 --> 12:28.172
- As you wish.
- 如你所愿。

12:28.241 --> 12:29.655
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

12:30.896 --> 12:32.620
- Oh, heavens.
- 哦，天哪。

12:32.689 --> 12:34.034
Disgusting.
恶心。

12:34.103 --> 12:36.034
Outrageous.
太离谱了。

12:36.103 --> 12:40.517
Our beautiful cabin's gone
from chateau to shanty.
我们美丽的小屋不见了
从城堡到棚户区。

12:40.586 --> 12:43.620
[lilting harpsichord music]
[轻快的羽管键琴音乐]

12:43.689 --> 12:45.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:45.655 --> 12:46.896
- Eww.
- 呃。

12:46.965 --> 12:48.241
- Oh, my.
- Oh.
- 哦，天哪。
- 哦。

12:48.310 --> 12:50.551
Regigilled!
重新调整！

12:51.448 --> 12:53.068
- As you wish.
- 如你所愿。

12:53.137 --> 12:54.586
Hmm hmm hmm.
嗯嗯嗯。

12:57.620 --> 13:00.655
- It's a bit lumpier
than I remember.
- 有点块状
比我记得的还要多。

13:00.724 --> 13:01.827
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

13:01.896 --> 13:04.344
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

13:04.413 --> 13:06.344
- This place is haunted!
- 这个地方闹鬼！

13:06.413 --> 13:07.758
[clock dings]
[钟声]

13:07.827 --> 13:10.275
Oh. Regigilled!
哦。重新调整！

13:11.379 --> 13:12.827
- As you wish.
- 如你所愿。

13:12.896 --> 13:14.103
Hmm hmm hmm.
嗯嗯嗯。

13:14.172 --> 13:15.448
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

13:15.517 --> 13:17.862
- Will there be anything else?
-还会有别的事吗？

13:17.931 --> 13:18.931
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

13:18.965 --> 13:20.896
- As you wish.
- 如你所愿。

13:20.965 --> 13:22.689
- [evil laughter]
- [邪恶的笑声]

13:24.034 --> 13:26.620
- Thanks for removing
that helicopter thingy.
- 感谢您删除
那个直升机的东西。

13:26.689 --> 13:29.862
But now my stomach
is empty again.
但现在我的胃
又是空的。

13:29.931 --> 13:31.275
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

13:31.344 --> 13:32.758
Food!
食物！

13:34.379 --> 13:35.793
- Imbeciles.
- 低能儿。

13:35.862 --> 13:37.517
[flies buzzing]
[苍蝇嗡嗡声]

13:37.586 --> 13:38.724
Ay.
哎呀。

13:38.793 --> 13:43.034
This cabin was
spotless when I left.
这间小屋是
我离开时一尘不染。

13:43.103 --> 13:44.241
[gasps]
[喘气]

13:44.310 --> 13:46.931
My scalpels, my clamps,
我的手术刀，我的夹子，

13:47.000 --> 13:51.172
my slashing tools... all gone!
我的砍刀工具……全没了！

13:51.241 --> 13:52.241
Huh?
啊？

13:52.310 --> 13:53.655
[rustling]
[沙沙声]

13:53.724 --> 13:55.275
Who's there?
谁在那里？

13:55.344 --> 13:58.034
Does someone have a boo boo?
有人有嘘声吗？

13:58.103 --> 14:02.793
Do you need Nurse Helga
to put you back together?
你需要赫尔加护士吗
让你们重新在一起？

14:04.034 --> 14:05.793
Phew.
唷。

14:05.862 --> 14:07.344
[screaming]
[尖叫]

14:07.413 --> 14:09.517
- [evil laughter]
- [邪恶的笑声]

14:10.586 --> 14:13.655
- Will you please keep it down?
- 请你小声点好吗？

14:13.724 --> 14:15.068
- Shh.
- 嘘。

14:15.137 --> 14:17.862
That was obviously a werewolf.
那分明就是一个狼人。

14:17.931 --> 14:21.103
- But it's daytime,
and there's no moon.
- 但现在是白天
而且没有月亮。

14:21.172 --> 14:25.551
- Then it must be some sort
of marauding camp creeper.
- 那么一定是某种
掠夺营地爬行者。

14:25.620 --> 14:27.896
- We have bigger problems.
- 我们有更大的问题。

14:27.965 --> 14:31.000
It appears there's
no mechanism for zipping.
看来有
没有拉链机制。

14:31.068 --> 14:34.103
- Then let's improvise.
- 那么我们来即兴发挥吧。

14:34.172 --> 14:35.172
- Yeah.
- 是的。

14:35.241 --> 14:38.137
[laughter]
[笑声]

14:38.206 --> 14:40.724
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

14:40.793 --> 14:41.862
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

14:43.310 --> 14:46.068
[screaming]
[尖叫]

14:47.241 --> 14:48.517
Ow.
噢。

14:51.068 --> 14:53.103
[screams]
[尖叫声]

14:53.172 --> 14:57.517
My posterior has suffered
a double cranial concussion.
我的后背已受苦
双颅脑震荡。

14:58.793 --> 15:01.379
- It's not looking so good.
- 看起来不太好。

15:02.620 --> 15:05.758
- Oh, no, his butt is wiped out.
- 哦，不，他的屁股已经被毁掉了。

15:07.344 --> 15:09.034
[screaming]
[尖叫]

15:09.103 --> 15:10.551
- Thank you, Kevin.
- 谢谢你，凯文。

15:10.620 --> 15:14.379
But I'm sure my butt
doesn't look that bad.
但我确信我的屁股
看起来没那么糟糕。

15:14.448 --> 15:16.965
- Hey, where's Kevin?
- 嘿，凯文在哪儿？

15:18.482 --> 15:21.413
Kevin, quit goofing around.
凯文，别再胡闹了。

15:21.482 --> 15:22.965
[screams]
[尖叫声]

15:23.034 --> 15:26.620
I got a feeling there's
something supernatural
我有一种感觉
超自然的东西

15:26.689 --> 15:28.620
going on around here.
这里正在发生。

15:28.689 --> 15:31.448
- I've got a feeling too.
- 我也有一种感觉。

15:31.517 --> 15:33.310
In my glutes.
在我的臀部。

15:33.379 --> 15:35.413
[sobs]
[抽泣]

15:37.344 --> 15:39.931
- [sniffing]
- [嗅嗅]

15:40.000 --> 15:42.896
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

15:42.965 --> 15:44.344
Food. Snacks.
食物。零食。

15:44.413 --> 15:45.413
Food. Snacks.
食物。零食。

15:45.448 --> 15:46.620
Oof!
钱币！

15:47.517 --> 15:50.137
The Krusty Kanteen!
库斯蒂坎廷！

15:50.206 --> 15:51.517
Hug!
拥抱！

15:51.586 --> 15:54.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

15:56.620 --> 16:00.206
Let no man say I didn't try.
不要让任何人说我没有尝试过。

16:00.275 --> 16:01.827
[rustling]
Huh?
[沙沙声]
啊？

16:01.896 --> 16:04.758
Is someone blorping at me?
有人对我吹气吗？

16:07.103 --> 16:09.137
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

16:09.206 --> 16:13.379
- Just one more drum of expired
Chum left to illegally dump.
- 只剩一桶过期了
密友留下来非法倾倒垃圾。

16:13.448 --> 16:15.931
- I don't know why
you insisted on coming
- 我不知道为什么
你坚持要来

16:16.000 --> 16:19.034
all the way out here
just to dump some Chum.
一直到这里
只是为了甩掉一些密友。

16:19.103 --> 16:21.137
- Because not even
an idiot would
- 因为甚至没有
一个白痴会

16:21.206 --> 16:22.620
come all the way out here.
千里迢迢来到这里。

16:22.689 --> 16:24.103
- Hi, Mr. Plankton.
- 嗨，浮游生物先生。

16:24.172 --> 16:26.000
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

16:27.241 --> 16:29.103
Oh, it's you.
哦，是你。

16:29.172 --> 16:30.965
What are you doing here?
你在这里做什么？

16:31.034 --> 16:32.827
[screams]
[尖叫声]

16:32.896 --> 16:35.172
- We're here for the party.
- 我们是来参加聚会的。

16:35.241 --> 16:39.137
Didn't you get an invite
to the Kamp Koral reunion?
你没有收到邀请吗
参加 Kamp Koral 聚会？

16:39.206 --> 16:40.758
- Reunion?
- 重聚？

16:40.827 --> 16:44.517
Why would I go to
a dumb daycare reunion?
我为什么要去
愚蠢的日托聚会？

16:45.413 --> 16:47.482
[screams]
[尖叫声]

16:47.551 --> 16:49.827
- 'Cause we're getting hungry.
- 因为我们饿了。

16:49.896 --> 16:52.586
And you were the cook here once.
你曾经是这里的厨师。

16:52.655 --> 16:56.241
So why don't you
get cookin', cook?
那你为什么不
做饭吧，做饭吗？

16:56.310 --> 16:57.413
- Cook?
- 厨师？

16:57.482 --> 16:59.379
I'll cook your face.
我来煮你的脸。

16:59.448 --> 17:01.551
- Easy, tiger.
- 简单，老虎。

17:01.620 --> 17:05.275
Let's play along
so they don't report us.
我们一起玩吧
所以他们不会举报我们。

17:05.344 --> 17:07.068
- Ugh, fine.
- 呃，好吧。

17:09.655 --> 17:12.551
Come and get it!
快过来取！

17:12.620 --> 17:14.241
You lousy punks.
你们这些糟糕的小混混。

17:16.344 --> 17:17.965
- You're not really
gonna feed them
- 你不是真的
会喂他们

17:18.034 --> 17:20.172
this putrid Chum, are you?
这个腐烂的密友，是你吗？

17:20.241 --> 17:21.482
- Sure.
- 当然。

17:21.551 --> 17:23.965
Polluting campers is
more environmentally conscious
污染露营者的是
更有环保意识

17:24.034 --> 17:27.275
than polluting the lake,
right, noodle brain?
比起污染湖泊，
对吧，面条脑？

17:27.344 --> 17:29.931
- Mmm. Brain noodles.
- 嗯。脑面条。

17:33.241 --> 17:35.689
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

17:38.517 --> 17:40.379
[growls]
[咆哮]

17:40.448 --> 17:42.379
- Suddenly I'm not hungry.
- 突然我不饿了。

17:42.448 --> 17:43.517
- Bleh.
- 布莱赫。

17:43.586 --> 17:45.896
Me neither.
我也不。

17:45.965 --> 17:49.827
Hey, does anybody want
to play some volleyball?
嘿嘿，有人要吗
打排球吗？

17:49.896 --> 17:52.896
- Does a one-legged duck
swim in circles?
- 是一只单腿鸭子吗
绕圈游？

17:52.965 --> 17:55.689
[cheering]
[欢呼]

17:55.758 --> 17:57.517
- Hey, wait for me!
- 嘿，等等我！

17:57.586 --> 17:59.241
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

18:03.413 --> 18:05.448
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

18:05.517 --> 18:07.379
Ahh.
啊。

18:07.448 --> 18:08.379
- Meep.
- 米普。

18:08.448 --> 18:09.448
- Meep.
- 米普。

18:09.517 --> 18:10.862
- [muffled gagging]
- [低声作呕]

18:12.310 --> 18:13.413
- Yuck.
- 恶心。

18:13.482 --> 18:15.379
I've been sullied.
我已经被玷污了

18:15.448 --> 18:16.965
I need a shower.
我需要洗个澡。

18:17.034 --> 18:18.241
[sobs]
[抽泣]

18:18.310 --> 18:20.275
- Wait! Don't shower!
- 等待！不要洗澡！

18:20.344 --> 18:22.931
Have you never seen
a horror movie?
你没见过吗
恐怖电影？

18:23.000 --> 18:26.137
The creeper will get you!
爬行者会抓住你的！

18:26.206 --> 18:29.068
[distant howling]
[远处的嚎叫]

18:30.275 --> 18:31.931
I'm alone.
我还是孤单一人。

18:32.000 --> 18:36.344
That's against
the horror movie rules too.
那是反对
恐怖电影也有规则。

18:36.413 --> 18:38.137
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

18:39.310 --> 18:40.551
- [retches]
- [干呕]

18:40.620 --> 18:43.241
Meep. Meep. Meep!
米普。米普。米普！

18:44.758 --> 18:47.103
- Meep. Meep. Meep.
- 米普。米普。米普。

18:47.172 --> 18:49.310
- [evil laughter]
- [邪恶的笑声]

18:51.448 --> 18:52.965
- [whistles]
- [口哨]

18:54.379 --> 18:55.379
- Meep!
- 米普！

18:55.448 --> 18:57.413
- [evil laughter]
- [邪恶的笑声]

18:57.482 --> 19:00.413
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

19:00.482 --> 19:05.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:05.517 --> 19:07.206
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

19:11.482 --> 19:13.034
- Ooh, that's good.
- 哦，那很好。

19:13.103 --> 19:15.344
I can never get back there.
我永远无法回到那里。

19:15.413 --> 19:18.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:18.482 --> 19:21.344
Harvey, is that you?
哈维，是你吗？

19:23.206 --> 19:24.586
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

19:24.655 --> 19:26.275
[gasps]
[喘气]

19:26.344 --> 19:29.344
[screams]
[尖叫声]

19:29.413 --> 19:32.068
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

19:34.344 --> 19:35.862
So clean.
这么干净。

19:35.931 --> 19:39.137
So terrifyingly clean.
干净得可怕。

19:40.551 --> 19:42.758
[screaming]
[尖叫]

19:42.827 --> 19:49.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:59.344 --> 20:02.620
So clean.
这么干净。

20:02.689 --> 20:05.137
- [evil laughter]
- [邪恶的笑声]

20:05.206 --> 20:06.793
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

20:06.862 --> 20:08.344
[cheering]
[欢呼]

20:08.413 --> 20:10.793
- While we're stuck
at this dirty camp,
- 当我们陷入困境时
在这个肮脏的营地里，

20:10.862 --> 20:13.206
who's gonna be
the volleyball champ?
谁会是
排球冠军？

20:13.275 --> 20:14.551
- Get ready.
- 准备好。

20:14.620 --> 20:17.206
I call this serve
the "Hey, mister,
我称之为服务
“嘿，先生，

20:17.275 --> 20:21.344
can we get our
ball back, please?"
我们能得到我们的
请回球吧？”

20:21.413 --> 20:22.655
[grunts]
- Ow!
[咕哝]
- 噢！

20:25.965 --> 20:28.379
- Owie, wowie,
that's gotta stingy.
- 奥伊，哇伊，
那就太小气了

20:28.448 --> 20:32.068
Hit her back, whack attack,
let's go Dinghies!
打她的背，重击攻击，
我们去小艇吧！

20:32.137 --> 20:33.827
- I got it!
- 我得到了它！

20:35.586 --> 20:36.689
Ah.
啊。

20:36.758 --> 20:39.655
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

20:39.724 --> 20:42.758
Oh, a wise guy, eh?
哦，一个聪明人，是吗？

20:42.827 --> 20:45.620
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

20:45.689 --> 20:48.137
- [evil laughter]
- [邪恶的笑声]

20:48.206 --> 20:50.310
- [laughing]
- [笑]

20:50.379 --> 20:51.896
- Whatcha laughin' at?
- 笑什么？

20:51.965 --> 20:53.838
- I'm just laughing because
the woods are laughing.
- 我只是笑因为
树林在笑。

20:53.862 --> 20:56.793
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

20:56.862 --> 20:57.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

20:57.965 --> 20:59.793
- Hey, where's Mo?
- 嘿，莫在哪儿？

20:59.862 --> 21:02.551
- Obviously incinerated by me.
- 显然是被我烧毁了。

21:02.620 --> 21:05.172
- I think you mean intimidated.
- 我认为你的意思是受到恐吓。

21:05.241 --> 21:07.206
- Yeah.
- 是的。

21:07.275 --> 21:08.344
- Whatever.
- 任何。

21:08.413 --> 21:10.689
We're still gonna
destroy you, dude.
我们还是要
毁了你，伙计。

21:10.758 --> 21:13.586
Hey, Tall Tail,
you're subbed in.
嘿，高尾巴，
你被替换了。

21:13.655 --> 21:15.310
- Come on, Tall Tail.
- 来吧，高尾巴。

21:15.379 --> 21:16.517
Pull up your socks.
拉起你的袜子。

21:16.586 --> 21:19.965
Smash that ball,
win it all, let's go jocks!
击碎那个球，
赢得一切，让我们加油！

21:20.034 --> 21:23.241
- I call this serve Deep Impact.
- 我称之为“深度影响”发球。

21:23.310 --> 21:24.310
Whoop!
哎哟！

21:25.310 --> 21:26.310
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

21:26.344 --> 21:27.413
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

21:28.482 --> 21:29.413
- Huh?
- 啊？

21:29.482 --> 21:31.103
[groans]
[呻吟]

21:36.862 --> 21:38.862
Barely hit me.
差一点就打到我了。

21:40.482 --> 21:41.586
- I'll get it.
- 我会得到它。

21:41.655 --> 21:42.862
- I'll come with you.
- 我跟你一起去。

21:42.931 --> 21:46.000
- [evil laughter]
- [邪恶的笑声]

21:47.275 --> 21:49.827
- [laughing]
- [笑]

21:49.896 --> 21:52.862
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

21:52.931 --> 21:55.862
- Mr. Krabs, the Yacht Cabin,
- 蟹老板先生，游艇小屋，

21:55.931 --> 21:58.241
Kevin, Nurse Helga,
凯文，赫尔加护士，

21:58.310 --> 22:03.068
the Anchovies, Bubble Bass,
and now the jocks
凤尾鱼、泡泡鲈鱼、
现在运动员们

22:03.137 --> 22:06.034
have all mysteriously
disappeared.
都神秘地拥有
消失了。

22:06.103 --> 22:09.827
- Oh, they're probably
just somewhere having fun.
- 哦，他们可能是
只是在某个地方玩得开心。

22:09.896 --> 22:10.965
Ahh!
啊！

22:11.034 --> 22:13.482
- Somewhere in their graves.
- 在他们坟墓的某个地方。

22:13.551 --> 22:17.068
- I'm sure there's a perfectly
good, highly reasonable,
- 我确信有一个完美的
很好，非常合理，

22:17.137 --> 22:19.482
scientifically proven
explanation
科学证明
解释

22:19.551 --> 22:22.000
for their disappearances.
对于他们的失踪。

22:22.068 --> 22:24.827
And besides, not all
the jocks are gone.
此外，并非所有
运动员们都走了。

22:24.896 --> 22:26.586
Tall Tail is still...
高尾还是...

22:26.655 --> 22:30.758
jumping flap jacks, he's gone!
跳襟翼开合，他走了！

22:30.827 --> 22:33.896
- The camp creeper
strikes again.
- 营地爬行者
再次罢工。

22:33.965 --> 22:36.344
- This reunion's not so fun.
- 这次重聚没那么有趣。

22:36.413 --> 22:38.862
The cheerleader's
always the next one.
啦啦队长的
总是下一个。

22:38.931 --> 22:41.827
Gimme a C-R-Y!
给我一个 C-R-Y！

22:41.896 --> 22:45.034
[crying]
[哭泣]

22:45.103 --> 22:47.827
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

[欢快的音乐]